# Build intermediates (root). Only site/data/ is committed. team_stats /
# net_ratings are regenerated every run by build_player_stats.py; the lineup
# *_man_*_stats_*.csv are regenerated per season by build_lineups.py (current
# season nightly, past seasons via OVERRIDE_SEASON). Past-season lineup JSON
# already lives under site/data/, so these root CSVs never need to be tracked.
/team_stats_*.csv
/net_ratings_*.csv
/[0-9]_man_*_stats_*.csv

